      <activity id="950e2cff-574e-5d11-968b-a26644c808f5" activityNameId="89d1232b-1fd0-5641-91bf-9a32ea625612" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Mine, gold</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Mine, gold
This data set includes land use of the considered mines ( underground) incl. revegetated areas as well as estimates of buildings and machinery of the mine based on the data set non-ferrous metal, mine, surface/underground.;
UUID: 1ddd6221-1879-3be8-85ef-3fe99e41647a
Land use, buildings and machinery for mining
Location: Land use of South-African mine, other inputs based on rough assumptions.
Technology: Assumptions for buildings and machinery based on the data set "non-ferrous metal, mine, surface/underground with 50 years life time.
Time period: Period of public environmental report
Production volume: 2.1 Mill. t ore
Sampling: environmental report 
Extrapolations: Buildings and machinery are based on global assumptions. The figures are extrapolated on the basis of the ore production.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_1ddd6221-1879-3be8-85ef-3fe99e41647a.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
